      "id": 101,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Pending Actions / Requires Action First\nUse these shortlists as the first operational queue for the SOC. **M365 Accounts** rise when they accumulate incidents, risky sign-in signals or repeated suspicious activity. **Assets** rise when they combine high-risk threats, KEV or active CVE exposure, and externally visible attack surface.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0",
      "title": "Pending Actions Guidance",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
